# Target code

```ts
console.log("Hello, Bert");
console.log("Hello, Lucy");

```


# Query

```grit
`console.log($message)` where {
    $name = "Lucy",
    $message <: r`"([a-zA-Z]*), Lucy"`($greeting) => `$name, $greeting`
}

```


# Matches

2:1-2:27
console.log("Hello, Lucy");


